#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:7
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "用户指南"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:10
msgid "Make a result reproducible"
msgstr "让结果可复现"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:13
msgid ""
"Preserve the executable graph and enough scientific context for another "
"person to understand, rerun, and challenge the result."
msgstr "保留可执行图和足够的科学上下文，使他人能够理解、重跑并质疑该结果。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:17
msgid "Record the experiment contract"
msgstr "记录实验契约"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:19
msgid "Before sharing a result, record:"
msgstr "分享结果前请记录："

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:21
msgid "the exact Template ID, graph file, or committed artifact revision;"
msgstr "精确的 Template ID、图文件或已提交产物修订；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:22
msgid "dataset source, sizes, split seed, preprocessing, and sampling mode;"
msgstr "数据集来源、大小、划分种子、预处理和采样模式；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:23
msgid "model architecture, initialization seed, and relevant dimensions;"
msgstr "模型架构、初始化种子和相关维度；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:24
msgid "optimizer, learning-rate and batch schedules, and regularization;"
msgstr "优化器、学习率和批量调度，以及正则化；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:25
msgid "steps or epochs, log frequency, compute device, and software environment;"
msgstr "步数或 epoch、记录频率、计算设备和软件环境；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:26
msgid "every Observable used to support the conclusion and its settings;"
msgstr "用于支持结论的每个 Observable 及其设置；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:27
msgid "the number of seeds and how runs were aggregated;"
msgstr "种子数量和运行聚合方式；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:28
msgid "the expected result and the condition that would count against it."
msgstr "预期结果，以及会对其构成反证的条件。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:30
msgid "Preserve the right evidence"
msgstr "保留恰当证据"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:32
msgid ""
"Use Small when the graph and parameters are enough to rerun the experiment. "
"Use Medium when the exact plotted history is part of the evidence. Use Large"
" only when trained model state must be inspected or resumed, and document "
"its size and handling requirements."
msgstr ""
"当图和参数足以重跑实验时使用 Small；当精确绘图历史是证据的一部分时使用 Medium；仅当必须检查或恢复训练模型状态时使用 "
"Large，并记录其大小和处理要求。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:37
msgid ""
"Keep machine-local credentials and unrelated workspace state out of all "
"three tiers. A screenshot can orient a reader or show expected evidence, but"
" it is not a substitute for numeric data, the graph artifact, or environment"
" details."
msgstr "让本机凭据和无关工作区状态远离所有三个层级。截图可帮助读者定位或展示预期证据，但不能替代数值数据、图产物或环境细节。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:41
msgid "State the claim boundary"
msgstr "说明结论边界"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:43
msgid ""
"A completed graph does not prove paper-faithful reproduction. Similar-"
"looking curves do not prove numeric agreement. A single seed does not "
"establish a distributional result, and a saved checkpoint does not describe "
"the data or measurement protocol that produced it."
msgstr "完成的图不能证明忠实复现论文。外观相似的曲线不能证明数值一致。单个种子不能建立分布性结果，保存的检查点也不能说明生成它的数据或测量协议。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:48
msgid "Label the result accurately:"
msgstr "准确标注结果："

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:50
msgid "**Smoke test:** the execution and result-routing path works."
msgstr "**Smoke test：** 执行和结果路由路径可用。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:51
msgid "**Phenomenon reproduction:** the setup demonstrates a qualitative behavior."
msgstr "**Phenomenon reproduction：** 该设置展示了一种定性行为。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:52
msgid ""
"**Paper-faithful reproduction:** the documented implementation, data, "
"protocol, and evaluation match the target closely enough for the stated "
"comparison."
msgstr "**Paper-faithful reproduction：** 文档化的实现、数据、协议和评估与目标足够吻合，可支撑所述比较。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/reproducibility.md:56
msgid ""
"The reproduction pages in [Examples](../examples/index.md) state this "
"boundary and list their limitations explicitly."
msgstr "[示例](../examples/index.md)中的复现页面说明了这一边界，并明确列出其局限性。"
